{
  "id": "1SA.20",
  "number": "20",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samwil 20",
  "verseCount": 42,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "20",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 20"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "20",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi ringo kud i Naioth i Rama, man ebino, ewacu de i wang’ Yonathan kumae, Atimo ang’o? kier para en e ang’o? man dubo para en e ang’o i wang’ wuru, m’uketho eyenyo kwo para? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu ire kumae, Awene; ibitho ngo: nen, vwa timo gin moko ngo kadok ma dit kadi ma nok de ngo, ma k’eyero ira ngo; man vwa mung’o maeni ira mir ang’o? en e kumeno ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kendo Daudi kwong’o man ewacu kumae, Wuru ng’eyo andha nia anwang’u bero i weng’i; man ewacu kumae, Yonathan kud ung’ei maeni, can umaru nege: ento andha calu Yehova bedo kwo, man calu ng’eyong’ec peri bedo kwo, dakutielo acel kende ma ni i kindwa waku tho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonathan ulund uwacu ni Daudi kumae, Gin ma tek ng’eyong’ec peri yenyo, abitime iri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 28:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Daudi wacu ni Yonathan kumae, Nen, urwo dwi bipor, man maku kud akwer bedo kud ubimo dhu cemo: ento wek acidhi, kara apond i podho cil i ceng’ mir adege uthieno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tek wuru neno nia ambe, e iwac kumae, Daudi penja ngili ngili nia ayi ering i Beth-lehem m’adhura pare; kum en e lam ma ku ba rundi kuca ni wat ceke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tek ewacu kumae, Ebedo dre; jatic peri bibedo ma cwinye kwio: ento tek kwinyo nege, ibilund ng’eyo nia ekeco lembe ma rac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka kumeno tim ku bero ku jatic peri; kum ikelo jatic peri i lembariba pa Yehova karacelo kudi: ento tek kier ni i ia, nega in giri; kum nedi ikela ba wuru? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yonathan uwacu kumae, Ebed bor i kumi; kum tek ang’eyo nia vwa keco lembe ma rac moko nyanok i kumi, e ayero iri ngo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi lund uwacu ni Yonathan kumae, Ng’a ma biyero ira tek kuno wuru dwoko lembe iri ma teki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yonathan uwacu ni Daudi kumae, Bin, wek wacidh i podho. E gicidho gin ario i podho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yonathan uwacu ni Daudi kumae, Yehova, Mungu mir Israel, ubed lamulembe: kinde m’arondo vwa urwo calu unyoni, kadi i ceng’ mir adege, nen, tek bero nuti yo ba Daudi, abilund oro kwenda i beng’i ngo, man anyuthe iri ngo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova tim kumeno ba Yonathan, man mange bende, tek ebibedo ber ni vwa ya etimi rac, tek atuce iri ngo, man aciki ngo, kara icidh ku kwiocwiny: man Yehova bed kudi, calu ebedo ku vwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ibinyutho ira mer mi bero pa Yehova i nindo m’abedo ie kwo kende ngo, kara kud atho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.9.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 9:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento ibijigo bero peri ngo bende kud i ot para mi nja; ungo, kadok kinde ma Yehova kabu judegi pa Daudi kubang’gi kubang’gi kud i wang’ ng’om. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Yonathan utimo lembariba ku ot pa Daudi, ewacu kumae, Man Yehova bilwong’e i cing’ judegi pa Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yonathan uketho Daudi ukwong’ kendo, ni kum mer m’emare ko; kum emare calu emaru ng’eyong’ec pare gire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonathan ulund uwacu ire kumae, Urwo dwi bipor; man jubiyenyi, kum kom peri bibedo kende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kan ibedo ceng’ adek, ibiloro piny pio, man ibibedo i ka m’ipondo i ie kinde ma jubeneno i lembe maeni, man ibidong’ kum kidi Ezel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abikilo athero adek i ng’ete, calu abekilo girakila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man, nen, abioro nyathin, abiwacu kumae, Cidhi, yeny athero. Tek awacu ni nyathinne kumae, Nen, athero ni yor i ng’ei; gamgi, man ibin; kum kwiocwiny ni i beng’i man lem ma rac ungo, calu Yehova bedo kwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento tek awacu kumae ni nyathinne, Nen, athero gini i weng’i; cidh i yo peri; kum Yehova ketho icidhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man lembe ma wayero pire wakudi, nen, Yehova ni i kindwa wakudi mi nja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Daudi pondo i podho; e kinde ma dwi por, ubimo bedo piny kara ecam cemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ubimo bedo wi kom pare calu ma naka, wi kom ma ni i ng’et gang’; e Yonathan ucungo, man Abner ubedo i ng’et Saul: ento kaka Daudi dong’ kende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Saul uyero lem moko ngo i ceng’ maeca: kum ie paru kumae, Gin moko time, e leng’ ungo; andha e leng’ ungo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre urwone yo ng’ei por pa dwi, ma en e ceng’ mir arionde, nia kaka Daudi dong’ kende: man Saul uwacu ni Yonathan ma wode kumae, Nedi wod Yese bino ngo ba cemo, kadok nyaworo, kadi tini? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yonathan uloko lembe ni Saul kumae, Daudi penjo ngili ngili nia ayi eci Beth-lehem: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man ewacu kumae, Wek acidhi, akwei; kum wat mwa gibedo ku lam i adhura; man umira ng’olo ira nia abed kuca: man kawono tek anwang’u bero i weng’i, wek acidhi, akwei, man anen utumira. Ka kumeno ebino ngo dhu mesa p’ubimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’ecwiny pa Saul ulund uopo kum Yonathan, man ewacu ire kumae, In i wod dhaku ma jaswa ma jaco de, nwang’u ang’eyo ngo nia ifoyo wod Yese ni lewic peri giri, man ni lewic mi muneru pa meru? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum ma fodi wod Yese bedo kwo wi ng’om, ibicungo ngo, kadi ker peri de. Kum kumeno kawono ior kwenda man ikele i bang’a, kum ebitho andha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yonathan uloko lembe ni Saul ma won, man ewacu ire kumae, Nedi juketho etho? etimo ang’o? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Saul ucobe ve ku tong’ kara ecobe; ni kum maeni Yonathan ung’eyo nia won ukeco ya eneg Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Yonathan uai malu ku dhu mesa ku ng’ecwiny ma lake tek, man ecamu cemo ngo i ceng’ mir arionde mi dwije; kum can unege pi Daudi, kum won udieiig’o cwinye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre kugweno, nia Yonathan ucidho i podho i kinde m’eng’olo ni Daudi, man nyathin ma nok ni karacelo kude. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ewacu ni nyathin pare kumae, Ringi, iyeny athero m’akilo kawono. Man ka nyathinne ringo, ekilo athero yor i wang’e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ka nyathin ubino i ka ma Yonathan ukilo ie athero, Yonathan ulwong’o nyathinne, ewacu kumae, Athero ni yor i weng’i ngo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yonathan ulwong’o nyathin kumae, Ci pio, ku morkumi, kud igal. E nyathin pa Yonathan ucoko athero, man edwogo ba jadit pare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento nyathinne ng’eyo gin moko ngo: ndhu Yonathan ku Daudi kende e m’ung’eyo lembene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Yonathan umio jamcinge ba nyathin pare, man ewacu ire kumae, Cidhi, tergi i adhura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kinde ma nyathinne cidho, Daudi ai ku ka ma yor ariwa ma piny, man epodho arieba wang’e i ng’om, man erum gire wang’ adek: e gicwio limbgi, man giywagri, maram Daudi sagu ko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 20:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yonathan uwacu ni Daudi kumae, Cidh ku kwiocwiny, kum wadaru kwong’o wan ario ku nying’ Yehova, wawacu kumae, Yehova bibedo i kindwa wakudi, man i kind kodhina ku kodhini, mi nja. Man eai ecidho de: man Yonathan udok i adhura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.20.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.20.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
